    "name": "Bem Feedback API",
    "description": "Submit training corrections for `extract`, `classify`, and `join` events.\n\nFeedback is event-centric \u2014 each correction is attached to an event by its `eventID`,\nand the server resolves the correct underlying storage (extract/join transformations\nor classify route events) from the event's function type.\n\nSplit and enrich function types do not support feedback.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-22T02:02:28.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T02:02:28.000Z",
    "lastUpdatedBy": "35240",
    "uid": "35240-797263e7-0ebf-42e9-987b-cba659706fd9"
  },
